1
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,688
Ehh, it's good to see you too!

2
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:07,900
Did you come all this way just for me?

3
00:01:15,498 --> 00:01:15,998
Really?

4
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:18,583
You're making me blush...

5
00:01:19,733 --> 00:01:21,821
Come on, tell me about your day!

6
00:01:32,567 --> 00:01:33,067
Sure!

7
00:01:34,167 --> 00:01:36,017
Here, look—like this?

8
00:01:37,133 --> 00:01:38,133
Did I do it right?

9
00:01:45,598 --> 00:01:47,077
Huh, not exactly?

10
00:01:48,167 --> 00:01:50,804
Then show me how it should be, come on!

11
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:02,025
Like this?

12
00:02:03,133 --> 00:02:05,683
Up high, and waving both hands!

13
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,337
I've got it now, right?

14
00:02:23,267 --> 00:02:24,679
Okay, right leg...

15
00:02:25,767 --> 00:02:27,080
one, and two!

16
00:02:28,165 --> 00:02:30,343
Hey, did that actually look okay?

17
00:02:38,233 --> 00:02:39,970
Ehh, that bad, huh...

18
00:02:41,067 --> 00:02:43,105
I'm not as graceful as I thought.

19
00:02:49,398 --> 00:02:50,433
Wait, really?

20
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:53,162
I could've sworn I was...

21
00:02:54,265 --> 00:02:56,897
Ugh, my body just won't listen today!

22
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:17,250
Right hand waving, leg kicking...

23
00:03:18,333 --> 00:03:19,171
here goes!

24
00:03:20,267 --> 00:03:21,605
Did I get it that time?

25
00:03:31,498 --> 00:03:32,129
I did it?!

26
00:03:33,197 --> 00:03:34,388
Yay, finally!

27
00:03:35,433 --> 00:03:38,070
You have no idea how relieved I am!

28
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:43,525
Like this?

29
00:03:44,633 --> 00:03:46,796
Yep, looking left and nodding.

30
00:03:47,900 --> 00:03:48,738
How was that?

31
00:03:54,664 --> 00:03:55,164
Great!

32
00:03:56,167 --> 00:03:57,654
Then what's the next move?

33
00:03:58,767 --> 00:04:00,042
I'm warmed up now!

